flowchart TB
  subgraph Proc1[Process 1 DotNet Orchestrator]
    BOOT[Startup and Env Load]
    ORCH[AgentOrchestrator]
    WEB[Webhook Listener or Polling Connector]
    PIPE[Normalize Score Plan Policy Execute]
  end

  subgraph Proc2[Process 2 Python Intelligence Service]
    FAST[FastAPI Service]
    SVC[Scorer and Planner Backends]
    REG[Model Registry Profiles]
    CACHE[LRU Cache]
  end

  subgraph Data[Local State and Evidence]
    AUD[audit jsonl]
    CASE[cases db]
    TRACE[demo trace jsonl]
  end

  BOOT --> ORCH
  WEB --> ORCH --> PIPE
  PIPE -->|HTTP JSON| FAST
  FAST --> SVC
  REG --> SVC
  FAST --> CACHE

  PIPE --> AUD
  PIPE --> CASE
  PIPE --> TRACE
